4. received daily injections of insulin glargine and also take one to three kinds of oral medicine (not including secretagogues) patients, daily insulin glargine total dose more than 12IU but \ 3 times the upper limit of normal ALT\> or 3 times the upper limit of normal); The creatinine clearance rate of B. was \<60ml/min; C. anaemia caused by any cause of the disease; The results of pregnancy test in women of childbearing age of D. were positive.

Inclusion Criteria:

